<title>POLAND: GDANSKI JAN NET FALLS TO PLN 10.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>GDANSKI JAN NET FALLS TO PLN 10.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					 10.43 vs   13.18</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   16.18 vs   22.95</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 34.91 vs   30.81</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	66.85 vs   58.39</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Gdanski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
